@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix fdt-o: <https://w3id.org/fdt/fdt-o#>.
@prefix : <http://example.com/datastation/invalid/>.

# INVALID: hosted dataset without a data controller; depot catalogue listing a dataset.
:ds a dcat:Dataset, fdt-o:HostedDataset; dcterms:title "Orphan dataset".
:depot a dcat:Catalog, fdt-o:DepotCatalog; dcterms:title "Depot with a dataset in it"; dcat:dataset :ds.
